<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Animal Farm (George Orwell), &quot;Beasts of England&quot;</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1945</span><span class="sg-chain-h">its tune described as a blend of &quot;La Cucaracha&quot; and &quot;Oh My Darling, Clementine&quot;</span></li></ul></section>
